   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Going and travelling",
     "texto": [
      "For destinations without an article, use **nach** with names of cities and many countries: **Wir fahren nach Italien**. Some names take an article and use **in + accusative**: **in die Schweiz**, **in die USA**. To say where you are, use **in + dative**: **Wir sind in Italien / in der Schweiz**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Perfekt for travel",
     "texto": [
      "**Fahren, fliegen** and **reisen** form the Perfekt with **sein** when they describe a movement: **Wir sind nach Berlin gefahren**. **Besuchen** forms the Perfekt with **haben**: **Wir haben die Stadt besucht**. Learn the auxiliary together with the verb; not all verbs that involve movement follow a single rule."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
